E000R

E000: 4C
>SCR

>10 DIM T(10)
>20 INPUT "TABLE OF",N
>30 FOR I=1 TO 10:T(I)=N*I:NEXT I
>40 FOR I=1 TO 10
>50 PRINT I;" X ";N;" = ";T(I)
>60 NEXT I
>70 S=0:FOR I=1 TO 10:S=S+T(I):NEXT I
>80 PRINT "TOTAL: ";S
>90 END
>RUN
